{"3525500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blightveil", "steam_appid": 3525500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/b69214e5a9b08b23be83b69fe3482f7e.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1350 height=371 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kings, bound by the ties of a single rite, sought to purge the undead from the world — but a fatal mistake unleashed the devastating veil of <strong>Blightveil</strong> upon the lands. Its emergence doomed the rulers to a maddening curse, while mortals held their breath at the edge of the abyss, seeking salvation in ritual battles upon the arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blightveil </strong>is a fast-paced <strong>Action-MOBA</strong> where every attack and dodge comes down to your reflexes. With <strong>WASD</strong> controls and a <strong>NON-Targeting</strong> system (free-aim, no auto-lock), you have full control of your hero’s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHTNING-FAST COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, skill-based action with no auto-aim: every hit is earned, every mistake is felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/2575d395fe8d0a2f879817dd8ff89387.poster.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1170 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/2575d395fe8d0a2f879817dd8ff89387.webm?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/2575d395fe8d0a2f879817dd8ff89387.mp4?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE ARENAS &amp; THE GUARDIAN KINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena brings its own terrain and deadly mechanics. <strong>Guardian Kings step into the fight</strong> and change the rules on the fly. Defeat them—or feel their wrath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/3c20a07d481d53a1603c7e11d89f70b6.poster.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1170 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/3c20a07d481d53a1603c7e11d89f70b6.webm?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/3c20a07d481d53a1603c7e11d89f70b6.mp4?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TALENT &amp; RUNE SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your perfect build! <strong>120 talents</strong> and over <strong>15 rune abilities</strong> let you craft hundreds of combinations — adapt to any battle and any playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/7727f898bb048f2df6f2cba91c5808b9.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1560 height=414 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MATCH PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero grows during the match, unlocking new talents that can turn the tide of any clash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIVE HERO CLASSES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defenders</strong> — an unbreakable frontline that holds the push. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warriors</strong> — swift melee assassins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rangers</strong> — deadly damage from range.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mages</strong> — elemental power and battlefield control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healers</strong> — sustain and team support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/42738a94e82373bb22b547897a9271f2.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1560 height=343 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTENSIVE CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins, banners, emotes, and more—create a unique look for your hero and profile. We’re not revealing everything just yet; you’ll see more soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/a2e0e1df3ab9b2938dac6a6b8fd764f9.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1453 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Who knows — maybe you’ll be the one to get the <u><strong>key</strong></u> to the Arena? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Join our <strong>Discord!</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/b69214e5a9b08b23be83b69fe3482f7e.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1350 height=371 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kings, bound by the ties of a single rite, sought to purge the undead from the world — but a fatal mistake unleashed the devastating veil of <strong>Blightveil</strong> upon the lands. Its emergence doomed the rulers to a maddening curse, while mortals held their breath at the edge of the abyss, seeking salvation in ritual battles upon the arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blightveil </strong>is a fast-paced <strong>Action-MOBA</strong> where every attack and dodge comes down to your reflexes. With <strong>WASD</strong> controls and a <strong>NON-Targeting</strong> system (free-aim, no auto-lock), you have full control of your hero’s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHTNING-FAST COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, skill-based action with no auto-aim: every hit is earned, every mistake is felt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/2575d395fe8d0a2f879817dd8ff89387.poster.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1170 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/2575d395fe8d0a2f879817dd8ff89387.webm?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/2575d395fe8d0a2f879817dd8ff89387.mp4?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE ARENAS &amp; THE GUARDIAN KINGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena brings its own terrain and deadly mechanics. <strong>Guardian Kings step into the fight</strong> and change the rules on the fly. Defeat them—or feel their wrath!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/3c20a07d481d53a1603c7e11d89f70b6.poster.avif?t=1783432585\" width=1170 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525500/extras/3c20a07d481d53a1603c7e11d89f70b6.webm?t=1783432585\" type=\"video/w